{"id":"6eedc7cef16ac70e","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology.md","title":"Sheaves and Cohomology on Set-Coded Sites","display":"df-site-sheaf-cohomology — Sheaves and Cohomology on Set-Coded Sites","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology","aliases":["58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology"],"display":"df-site-sheaf-cohomology — Sheaves and Cohomology on Set-Coded Sites","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-site-sheaf-cohomology — Sheaves and Cohomology on Set-Coded Sites"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8fff134618bbd5c\" href=\"?note=d8fff134618bbd5c\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md\">../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cbc1735835617989\" href=\"?note=cbc1735835617989\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md\">../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,J,R,Q,X,f,\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ab},\\mathcal D,\\Gamma,H,i\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,J,R,Q,X,f,\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ab},\\mathcal D,\\Gamma,H,i\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatHom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CatHom}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S\\)</span> 使用范畴数据依赖；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(s_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(t_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gf\">\\(gf\\)</span> 是带相同范畴参数的对应记号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对站点代码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S=\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal S=\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SiteTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SiteTopology}_S\\)</span> 是下述两个投影；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S\\)</span> 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)\">\\(C=\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\mathrm{SiteTopology}_S(\\mathcal S)\">\\(J=\\mathrm{SiteTopology}_S(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(\\mathcal F)\">\\(F_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(\\mathcal F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(\\mathcal F)\">\\(F_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(\\mathcal F)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R,f,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R,f,\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SieveOn}_S(R,t_{\\mathcal C}(f),\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{SieveOn}_S(R,t_{\\mathcal C}(f),\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 时使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下述站点、层及上同调谓词的元数由各定义左端确定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ab}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ab}\\)</span> 是明确提供的阿贝尔值范畴。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"cbc1735835617989\" href=\"?note=cbc1735835617989\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md\">../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d8fff134618bbd5c\" href=\"?note=d8fff134618bbd5c\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md\">../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Site}\">\\(\\mathrm{Site}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SiteGlobalSectionsFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{SiteGlobalSectionsFunctor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SiteSheafCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{SiteSheafCategory}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}\">\\(\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sieve\\text{-}on}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SieveOn}_S(R,X,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land R\\subseteq\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C):t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n(t_{\\mathcal C}(g)=s_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\to fg\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sieve\\text{-}on}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SieveOn}_S(R,X,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land R\\subseteq\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C):t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n(t_{\\mathcal C}(g)=s_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\to fg\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pullback\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R,f,\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C):t_{\\mathcal C}(g)=s_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\land fg\\in R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pullback\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R,f,\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C):t_{\\mathcal C}(g)=s_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\land fg\\in R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}grothendieck\\text{-}topology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(J,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C):t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=X\\}\\in J(X)\n\\land\\forall R\\in J(X)\\;\\mathrm{SieveOn}_S(R,X,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in J(X)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n(t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=X\\to\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R,f,\\mathcal C)\\in J(s_{\\mathcal C}(f)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in J(X)\\;\\forall Q\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{SieveOn}_S(Q,X,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(Q,f,\\mathcal C)\\in J(s_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\bigr)\n\\to Q\\in J(X)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}grothendieck\\text{-}topology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(J,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C):t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=X\\}\\in J(X)\n\\land\\forall R\\in J(X)\\;\\mathrm{SieveOn}_S(R,X,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in J(X)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n(t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=X\\to\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R,f,\\mathcal C)\\in J(s_{\\mathcal C}(f)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in J(X)\\;\\forall Q\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{SieveOn}_S(Q,X,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(Q,f,\\mathcal C)\\in J(s_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\bigr)\n\\to Q\\in J(X)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}coded\\text{-}site}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\in V\\;\n(\\mathcal S=\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S(J,\\mathcal C)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}coded\\text{-}site}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\in V\\;\n(\\mathcal S=\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S(J,\\mathcal C)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}projections}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathcal C,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SiteTopology}_S(\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle)\\coloneqq J.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}projections}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathcal C,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SiteTopology}_S(\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle)\\coloneqq J.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(C),\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(C)\\;\\forall R\\in J(X)\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathsf{Ab})\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathsf{Ab})^R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[\\forall f\\in R\\;(a(f)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ab}}(A,F_0(s_C(f))))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(C)\\;\\Bigl(\nt_C(g)=s_C(f)\\to\n\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathsf{Ab},F_1(g),a(f))=a(\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(C,f,g))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ab}}(A,F_0(X))\\;\n\\forall f\\in R\\;(\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathsf{Ab},F_1(f),u)=a(f))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(C),\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(C)\\;\\forall R\\in J(X)\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathsf{Ab})\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathsf{Ab})^R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[\\forall f\\in R\\;(a(f)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ab}}(A,F_0(s_C(f))))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(C)\\;\\Bigl(\nt_C(g)=s_C(f)\\to\n\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathsf{Ab},F_1(g),a(f))=a(\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(C,f,g))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ab}}(A,F_0(X))\\;\n\\forall f\\in R\\;(\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathsf{Ab},F_1(f),u)=a(f))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\exists O\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;O=\\{F\\in\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S(\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)),\\mathsf{Ab}):\n\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(F,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal D,O,\n\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)),\\mathsf{Ab}\\right)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal D)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\exists O\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;O=\\{F\\in\\mathrm{FunctorCodes}_S(\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)),\\mathsf{Ab}):\n\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(F,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{FullFunctorSubcategory}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal D,O,\n\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)),\\mathsf{Ab}\\right)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal D)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}global\\text{-}sections}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SiteGlobalSectionsFunctor}_S(\\Gamma,X,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}_S(X,\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S\\!\\left(\\Gamma,X,\\mathcal D,\n\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)),\\mathsf{Ab}\\right)\n\\land\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}global\\text{-}sections}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SiteGlobalSectionsFunctor}_S(\\Gamma,X,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}_S(X,\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EvaluationFunctor}_S\\!\\left(\\Gamma,X,\\mathcal D,\n\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S)),\\mathsf{Ab}\\right)\n\\land\\mathrm{LeftExactFunctorIn}_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}cohomology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}_S(H,i,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land i\\in\\omega\\land\\exists X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S))\\;\n\\mathrm{SiteGlobalSectionsFunctor}_S(\\Gamma,X,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(H,\\Gamma,\\mathcal F,i,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}site\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}cohomology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}_S(H,i,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\land\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal S,\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land i\\in\\omega\\land\\exists X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{SiteCategory}_S(\\mathcal S))\\;\n\\mathrm{SiteGlobalSectionsFunctor}_S(\\Gamma,X,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RightDerivedValue}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(H,\\Gamma,\\mathcal F,i,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>站点的 Grothendieck 拓扑是对象上的覆盖筛族，不是一个集合上的开集拓扑；不能将站点直接代入拓扑空间的八元层上同调接口。</li>\n<li>这里展开正文所需的具有终对象的站点情形；小 étale 站点以基概形的恒等态射为终对象。</li>\n<li>值范畴、层范畴、全局截面函子和内射分解均被实际公式约束；不同终对象与分解的输出按目标范畴同构解释。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8fff134618bbd5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-functor-subcategory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md","status":"resolved","id":"cbc1735835617989","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-categorical-resolutions.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b